# COG-DYNAMIC-LEAD descriptive dynamics (daily spreads, 28 series x 34 assets)

Registered in forge/COG_DYNAMIC_LEAD_PREREG.md. Window: 2016 to 2026-08-20 (warm-up 2016; Discovery 2017-2020, Validation 2021-2023, out-of-sample 2024-2026-08).

