## D5 Failure rate

In D4, `active_share_wrong_sign` is the share of gated entries whose subsequent return went against the relationship's sign (50% = no information). D3 `share_followed_by_negative_within_250d` is the share of active-positive spells followed by an active-negative state within 250 days (relationship reversal).

